  m_Name: MiniRoverWheel
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  notes: 'mini_rover grousered 3D-printed wheel, collides as a sphere of the tread
    radius (VHACD hulls snagged; the mesh cylinder rolls with some contact jitter).
    Friction capped at 0.35 (Minimum combine): the bogie pivot is higher than half
    the bogie wheel spacing, so skid turns at ~0.5 friction flip the bogies.'
